{
 "file": "27KKI01A base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:29",
   "ptr": "0x29",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "「どうも変だと思ってたんだ。\\n",
   "en": "\"I knew something was off. The whole way here, those folks were creepy. Gave me a bad feeling...\"",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:4a",
   "ptr": "0x4a",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　あの連中、ここに連れて来るまで、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:29"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:71",
   "ptr": "0x71",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　ずっと無気味で、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:29"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:88",
   "ptr": "0x88",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　嫌な感じがしてたんだ・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　ずっと無気味で、\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:29"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:b1",
   "ptr": "0xb1",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「し、知らん！　おれたちは何も知らん！\\n",
   "en": "\"I-I don't know! We don't know anything! We just followed orders and tried to make them break the black crystal! Who'd have thought it'd end like that...\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:dc",
   "ptr": "0xdc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ただ、命令通り、あの連中に黒水晶を\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:b1"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:105",
   "ptr": "0x105",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　割らせようとしただけだ！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:b1"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:124",
   "ptr": "0x124",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　それが、まさかあんな・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　割らせようとしただけだ！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:b1"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:14d",
   "ptr": "0x14d",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「お前ら、こんなとこに何しに来た！？」\\f",
   "en": "\"What are you doing in a place like this?!\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:183",
   "ptr": "0x183",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「やめろ！　そいつに話しかけるな！」\\f",
   "en": "\"Stop! Don't talk to that one!\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:1b7",
   "ptr": "0x1b7",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "カイエス\\n",
   "en": "Caius",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:1c4",
   "ptr": "0x1c4",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「どういうことだ、これは？\\n",
   "en": "\"What is the meaning of this? What have you done?!\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "カイエス\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:1e3",
   "ptr": "0x1e3",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　お前たち、何をした！？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:1c4"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:203",
   "ptr": "0x203",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "軍隊長\\n",
   "en": "Commander",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:20e",
   "ptr": "0x20e",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "「ち、違う！　我々じゃない！\\n",
   "en": "\"N-No! It wasn't us! We were only ordered to come here.",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "軍隊長\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:22f",
   "ptr": "0x22f",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　我々はただ、命令を受けて、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:20e"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:250",
   "ptr": "0x250",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　ここに来ただけだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　我々はただ、命令を受けて、\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:20e"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:26a",
   "ptr": "0x26a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　連行した奴らが、あんなふうになるな\\n",
   "en": "We never dreamed the people we brought would end up like that!",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:293",
   "ptr": "0x293",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　んて、思ってもみなかったんだ！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:26a"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:2b9",
   "ptr": "0x2b9",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　奴ら、始めは従順について来てたのに、\\n",
   "en": "At first they followed along meekly, but once we entered these ruins, they started moving on their own...",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:2e4",
   "ptr": "0x2e4",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　この遺跡に入ってから、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:2b9"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:301",
   "ptr": "0x301",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　勝手に動きだして・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　この遺跡に入ってから、\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:2b9"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:31f",
   "ptr": "0x31f",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　止めようとしたとたん、\\n",
   "en": "The moment we tried to stop them, boom! They exploded! We lost a few men.",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:33c",
   "ptr": "0x33c",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　いきなり爆発だ！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　止めようとしたとたん、\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:31f"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:353",
   "ptr": "0x353",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　おかげで、何人かやられた。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　いきなり爆発だ！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:31f"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:375",
   "ptr": "0x375",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　・・・今、奴らは《封印の門》だ。\\n",
   "en": "...They're at the Gate of Seals now. If they all blow at once, sure, the black crystal will break, but this passage won't come through in one piece either...",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:39c",
   "ptr": "0x39c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　もし、いっぺんに爆発すれば、確かに\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:375"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:3c5",
   "ptr": "0x3c5",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　黒水晶は壊れるだろうが、この通路も\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:375"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:3ee",
   "ptr": "0x3ee",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　タダでは済まない・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:375"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:40c",
   "ptr": "0x40c",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　我々は撤退するぞ！\\n",
   "en": "We're pulling out! I'm not getting caught in that blast!\"",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:425",
   "ptr": "0x425",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　爆発に巻き込まれるのはゴメンだから\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　我々は撤退するぞ！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:40c"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:44e",
   "ptr": "0x44e",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "　な！」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:40c"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:45e",
   "ptr": "0x45e",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "軍隊長\\n",
   "en": "Commander",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:469",
   "ptr": "0x469",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「お前らが何者か知らんが、\\n",
   "en": "\"I don't know who you are, but if you want to die, suit yourselves.\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "軍隊長\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:488",
   "ptr": "0x488",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　死にたければ勝手にしろ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:469"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:4ad",
   "ptr": "0x4ad",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "「・・・・・・・・・」\\f",
   "en": "\".........\"",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:4c9",
   "ptr": "0x4c9",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "カイエス\\n",
   "en": "Caius",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:4d6",
   "ptr": "0x4d6",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "「こ、これは・・・！？」\\f",
   "en": "\"Wh-What is this...?!\"",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "カイエス\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:501",
   "ptr": "0x501",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "「・・・わ・・私の爆薬は・・\\n",
   "en": "\"...M-My... my explosives... seem to have failed. Being blown clear woke me from the dream.",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:522",
   "ptr": "0x522",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　不発だったようですね。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:501"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:53f",
   "ptr": "0x53f",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　吹き飛ばされたおかげで、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　不発だったようですね。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:501"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:55e",
   "ptr": "0x55e",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　夢から覚めましたよ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　吹き飛ばされたおかげで、\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:501"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:57a",
   "ptr": "0x57a",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　でも、もうダメです・・・\\n",
   "en": "But I'm finished... I took the full force of the 'Wave' you were just talking about...",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:599",
   "ptr": "0x599",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　あなたたちが今、話してた『波動』を、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　でも、もうダメです・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:57a"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:5c4",
   "ptr": "0x5c4",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　まともに浴びてしまいましたから・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:57a"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:5f0",
   "ptr": "0x5f0",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　・・・私は黒水晶が割れた時、\\n",
   "en": "...When the black crystal cracked, I caught a glimpse of what lies beyond it.",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:613",
   "ptr": "0x613",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　その奥にあるものを、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:5f0"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:62e",
   "ptr": "0x62e",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　わずかに見ることができました。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　その奥にあるものを、\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:5f0"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:654",
   "ptr": "0x654",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　そこには、通路などなかった・・・\\n",
   "en": "There was no passage there... Only a hole, stretching on and on into a vast, deep abyss.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:67b",
   "ptr": "0x67b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ただ、深く巨大な深淵へと続く穴が、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:654"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:6a4",
   "ptr": "0x6a4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　どこまでも広がってるばかりでした。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:654"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:6ce",
   "ptr": "0x6ce",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　その、深き穴の底から、\\n",
   "en": "And from the bottom of that deep hole... that 'Wave'...",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:6eb",
   "ptr": "0x6eb",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　あの『波動』が・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　その、深き穴の底から、\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:6ce"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:707",
   "ptr": "0x707",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　封印の門の水晶は、奥へ進む者を阻む\\n",
   "en": "The crystal of the Gate of Seals was no 'gate' to bar the way onward...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:730",
   "ptr": "0x730",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　『門』ではなかった・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:707"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:750",
   "ptr": "0x750",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　それは、まさに・・・\\n",
   "en": "It was truly... a 'seal' holding something enormous...",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:76b",
   "ptr": "0x76b",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　何か巨大なものを封じる\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　それは、まさに・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 27KKI01A:750"
  },
  {
   "id": "27KKI01A:788",
